# Payment Logs Directory
# 
# This directory stores payment processing logs.
# 
# Log entries for:
# - Payment intent creation
# - Webhook receipts from Stripe/OPay
# - Payment success/failure events
# - Refund requests
# - Fraud detection alerts
# 
# CRITICAL: These logs may contain PII and payment metadata
# Access restricted to authorized personnel only
# Retention: 1 year (compliance requirement)
# 
# DO NOT delete without compliance review.
